    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>Your natural regeneration can help you recuperate from wounds more quickly.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trandoshan\" title=\"Trandoshan\">Trandoshan</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b>&nbsp;Once per day when you catch a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Second_Wind\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Second Wind\">Second Wind</a>, you can regain no Hit Points immediately and instead regain 5 Hit Points at the end of each of your turns until you reach full Hit Points or until the end of the encounter (whichever comes first).</p>",
